      92.4,
      398.72,
      286.44,
      422.72
    ],
    "text": "My Reference No.: KDS/PAN/04/04/02/10. Land Ministry\u2019s Reference No.: 13/2000/FR/63.",
    "fonts": [
      "Latha-Bold,Italic",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      423.21,
      286.44,
      499.72
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub - section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intend to acquire the following Land/Servitude which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      4.079591751098633,
      5.039495944976807,
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      57.84,
      501.19,
      273.0,
      511.27
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or Servitude to be acquired :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      512.45,
      286.43,
      588.32
    ],
    "text": "Lot 01 of land called \u201cKetaloya Watta\u201d in total extent of about 20.3065 Hectares, depicted in PP Plan No. 6682 dated 24.05.2017 of prepared by the Surveyor General Situated in the Village Beddegama, Palispattu West Korale in the Divisionl Secretary\u2019s Division of Panwila in Kandy District, Central Province and Bounded as follow:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      590.7,
      286.44,
      687.2
    ],
    "text": "North: Ketaloya Watta titled by H. T. P. Gunathilaka (H.P. 49972) and Peragolla Oya East: Peragolla Oya and Lot No. 01 of P.P. Maha 6137 South: Lot No. 01 of P.P. Maha 6137 and Ketaloya Watta titled by S. K. Gunathilaka (H.P. 49972)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      16.078292846679688
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      360.31,
      542.28,
      427.76
    ],
    "text": "West: Ketaloya Watta titled by S. K. Gunathilaka (H. P. 49972) and Ketaloya Watta titled by H. T. P. Gunatilake (H. P. 49972) Name and address of the Claimant: H. G. M. Gunatilake, No. 11, D. S. Senanayake Street, Kandy.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      438.56,
      539.47,
      563.6
    ],
    "text": "All Persons interest in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Divisional Secretariat Panwila on the 22nd day of December, 2017 at 9.30 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 6th day of December, 2017 the nature of their interest in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      576.81,
      514.68,
      670.4
    ],
    "text": "J. P. U. K. JAYARATHNE, Divisional Secretary, Panwila Division. Divisional Secretary\u2019s Office, Panwila, 15th November, 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
